WEBVTT - AI tools: overview film (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.956
An AI tool that writes straight to live pages
leaves nobody to approve the change.

2
00:00:09.056 --> 00:00:17.010
This lab runs 11 AI tools for TYPO3 v14, and
people approve what they change.

3
00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:27.522
The AI chat asks before it writes, nr-llm keeps
one model setup, and Jev sorts form messages.

4
00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:39.014
Agentic skills teach coding agents TYPO3,
Skillflow runs review skills on drafts, and
Skillspector checks each skill first.

5
00:00:39.914 --> 00:00:54.503
The MCP Server and the Abilities Registry let
agents work within your rules. Agent Nexus shows
five protocols, Agentation points at elements,
and llms.txt maps the site.

6
00:00:55.703 --> 00:01:00.026
Try the AI tools on your own copy, with people
in charge.
